        "Instruction scheduling in compilers"
      ],

      "disadvantages": [
        "Only works on DAGs (no cycles)",
        "No unique ordering guarantee",
        "Cannot handle cyclic dependencies",
        "Requires precomputation of indegrees"
      ],

